{"id":"en_the-lost-heiress-they-cherish","title":"The Lost Heiress They Cherish","titleEn":"The Lost Heiress They Cherish","description":"Ye Sheng comes home to the Ye family as the daughter they lost years ago, only to face constant provocation from Ye Yuqian, the adopted sister. Along the way she develops feelings for Qin Wuwang, not realizing he is the very man she has been betrothed to by arrangement, and each of them is looking for a way out of that engagement. As she gradually earns the affection of her parents and her five brothers, Qin Wuwang ends up proposing to her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-lost-heiress-they-cherish/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-lost-heiress-they-cherish/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Group Pampering","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-lost-heiress-they-cherish_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-lost-heiress-they-cherish_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-lost-heiress-they-cherish_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-lost-heiress-they-cherish_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"